	text={
		[1]={
			{
"Arm in arm with Akari, the two of us wander the bustling streets of the Persica Blossom Festival.",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"Spring has come around to Tenkyo while I was away in Ne no Kuni.",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I never thought I'd get to enjoy the Persica Blossom Festival with you again.”",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Me neither.”",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'd love nothing more than to wander around the whole evening, but we should drop by here first.”",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			{
"Akari stops in front of the entrance to Miyoshi.",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			{
"The front door has a rarely seen “CLOSED” sign hanging from it.",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			{
"Akari reserved the entire place and invited all the people she owes a debt of gratitude to.",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			{
"But the main goal this evening is to give me a chance to show my face.",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What did you tell them happened to me, anyway?”",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I said you went off somewhere following your battle with Kahaku.”",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“But I'm pretty sure they interpreted that to mean you died.”",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“They're in for a real shock, huh?”",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Hehee. They sure are.”",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'll head in first. You just wait right here.”",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			{
"Akari turns and steps into the restaurant without a pause.",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Hey everyone!”",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“It is a pleasure to have you, Your Majesty.”",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“We are humbly at your service.”",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“A most pleasant evening, is it not?”",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“No need for all the stuffy greetings.”",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'm here today as Miyaguni Akari, not Empress Touka.”",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Wh-What business brings you here, pray tell?”",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Settle down, you.”",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Miyaguni-san, why don't you have a seat as well?”",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I will. But first, there's someone I wanna introduce.”",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			{
"Akari pokes her head out of the restaurant and beckons me in.",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			{
"That's my cue.",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			{
"What sort of face should I be putting on?",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			{
"A smile? Or maybe a more humble expression? Can't really say I've been in a situation like this before...",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“C'mon, you coming or what?”",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Y-Yeah.”",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			{
"Still undecided, I step across the threshold to Miyoshi.",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori & Elsa"},
			{
"“Huh?!” “What?”",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			{
"Hotori and Elsa freeze up at the same time.",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“S-Soujin-sama...”",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			{
"The entire restaurant falls silent.",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			{
"Everyone's looking at me with eyes wide as saucers.",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Much to my shame, I seem to have returned.”",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“O-Oni-Onii-sama?!”",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Ahh, awawawawa─a ghost, a gh-gh-gh-gh-gh-gh─?!”",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Evil spirits, begone! Evil spirits, begone! Evil spirits, begone!”",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I thought you were dead...”",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Sorry for not getting in touch.”",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I had to hide my identity while I recovered.”",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			{
"Shino reaches over and gives my arm a good squeeze.",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Hmm, sure feels like the real deal. I'll be wanting my funeral offerings back, just so you know.”",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“H-Hold it right there.”",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“If you're the real Soujin-kun, you'll want to touch my nape!”",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			{
"The manager invitingly lifts his long hair aside.",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Uh, no, I've never wanted to touch it.”",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Mm, that sort of anguished self-denial couldn't be anyone but Soujin-kun.”",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Ahahaha! Always knew you were one tough son of a bitch, but you sure got the last laugh.”",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			{
"Everyone reacts in their own ways.",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Onii-sama...”",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			{
"Kanami totters over in front of me.",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Why did you never write to me... all this time?”",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Do you have any idea... how much I...!”",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			{
"Kanami still believes I'm just an ordinary warrior.",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			{
"I'll have to tell her the truth later.",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“You will not leave us again, will you?”",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah, I won't.”",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Thank goodness. I am so happy!”",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			{
"Kanami throws her arms around me.",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Um, ahem.”",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Whoa there.”",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			{
"I peel Kanami away from me and plop her down in a nearby seat.",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Kanami's my own sister. Don't be jealous.”",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Wh-Who're you calling jealous? No idea what you're even talking about!”",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Hmm...? I've suspected it for a while now, but you two really are like ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"that,",
{"/font"},
" are you?”",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Huh? W-Well, you know... yeah.”",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Elsa-sama, Her Majesty and Soujin-sama are bound by destiny!”",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“To think of them as mere lovers would be an insult!”",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What are you so proud of?”",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“No idea!”",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			{
"Kotone emphatically declares with pride.",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Say, Tokita. Ain't it a bit, y'know, presumptuous for a lowborn warrior to get together with the Empress?”",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“The times are changing.”",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Or rather, I want us to serve as a symbol of the changing times.”",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Even if I'm the Empress, I'm still just an ordinary human.\nWho's to say I'm not allowed to marry whoever I want?”",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“You're already thinking about marriage...”",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Ah...”",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			{
"Akari sneaks a timid glance in my direction.",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			{
"Before I know it, all eyes in the room are on me.",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I don't know much about social propriety, but I fully intend to stay by Akari's side until my body gives out.”",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If possible... yeah, as her spouse.”",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Soujin...!”",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What about you?”",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Do you even need to ask, Soujin?!”",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I can't imagine having anyone at my side but you.”",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'll change all the rules that it takes to make it happen.”",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			{
"Akari peers up at me with glistening eyes.",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			{
"This delicate, precious girl in front of me─",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			{
"Being able to embrace her without any hesitation or reservations is all I could ask for.",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'll always protect you, Akari.”",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You're the sun in my sky.”",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Don't say that... It's embarrassing.”",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			{
"I gently wrap her slender frame in my embrace.",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			{
"A chorus of applause echoes around us.",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Ehehee, it looks like we have quite a lot to celebrate tonight.”",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			{
"Mutsumi-san drifts back into the kitchen with a smile.",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“All right! Let's drink till we drop!”",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Your friendly neighborhood florist Inui Takahito will cover the entire bill!”",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Thank you very much, sir! All my work selling flowers from dawn to dusk was well worth it!”",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			{
"So she also came by this year to help out at the shop, did she?",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Soujin, I wish you the best.”",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Onii-sama, I always knew this day would come, so...”",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Please accept my congratulations.”",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Look at you, proposing in public and everything.”",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Best wishes.”",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“That was wonderful!”",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			{
"Everyone proceeds to give us their blessings.",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			{
"My chest feels warm, as though a gentle spring breeze is blowing through.",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Thank you, everyone.”",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Today was just supposed to be about celebrating Soujin, so it's hard to believe it turned out like this.”",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			{
"Akari turns to me with a bashful smile on her face.",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“The two of us'll definitely live our best life going forward.”",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Not two. The three of us.”",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“What?”",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Where are you getting three of us from?”",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			{
"I point to Akari's stomach.",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			{
"...",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			{
"......",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			{
".........",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“N-No way...”",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It's all thanks to our child that I was able to make it back.”",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I-I knew it...”",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			{
"Akari silently screws up her lips as a cold sweat drips down her forehead.",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“How could you just say that in front of everyone?!”",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You're supposed to tell me this sorta thing first!”",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Sorry.”",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Don't-you-'sor-ry'-me-you-stu-pid-i-di-ot!”",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			{
"Akari furiously wraps her hands around my neck.",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Ghh! Can't breathe... Akari, I'm seriously... gonna...”",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			{
"Suddenly, a specter appears behind Akari.",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			{
"Oh, after coming back all this way to the realm of the living, am I already to be─",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			name={"name", name="???"},
			{
"“Ahahaha, I thought you to have gleaned some understanding of the human heart, but it seems you've still got a long way to go!”",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Ahh, awawawawa─a ghost, a gh-gh-gh-gh-gh-gh─?!”",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Haaaaaaaah! Evil spirits, begone! Evil spirits, begone!”",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Silence, Exalt-Priestess.”",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Eeep?!”",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			{
"Akari fearfully turns to look behind her.",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Huuhhh?!”",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Y-Your Majesty... Did you not disappear?”",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“I believed myself to have disappeared as well, but it would appear that I'm more stubborn than I imagined.”",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“I suspect it is because you fused yourself with my magatama.”",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Ah...”",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			{
"Now that she mentions it, Akari did absorb the broken halves of the Yasakani no Magatama into her body.",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			{
"Who could have foreseen this, though?",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“You did well to vanquish Kahaku. You have my sincere gratitude.”",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Your words unduly honor us.”",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Even though we sacrificed Your Majesty and Mitsurugi...”",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“It was unavoidable.”",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Well, if you still have any lingering sympathies, do endeavor to live happily on my and Mitsurugi's behalf.”",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“If you should ever fail to get along...”",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto wraps her incorporeal arms around my shoulders.",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“I'll gladly snatch Tokita right up.”",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I do apologize, Your Majesty, but there are some things I cannot forfeit, even to you.”",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Heheh, I would not have it any other way.”",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto drifts away from me.",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Until next time, then.”",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“I should think that my consciousness will only reawaken occasionally, so I expect you to preserve this body well.”",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			{
"Without even giving us time to bow our heads, Himi-no-Mikoto vanishes in a puff of smoke.",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“S-Soujin, what was that?”",
			},
		},
		[166]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'll explain it all later.”",
			},
		},
		[167]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Um, but...”",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Now, now, chairman, what's a little ghost or two among friends?”",
			},
		},
		[169]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Hows about we get down to business already?”",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“You're far too carefree!”",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			{
"The two house heads begin their boisterous bickering.",
			},
		},
		[172]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Looks like instead of three, there'll be four of us now.”",
			},
		},
		[173]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hahaha, better get used to it.”",
			},
		},
		[174]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Let's all four of us protect these peaceful times.”",
			},
		},
		[175]={
			{
"...Actually, make that five of us.",
			},
		},
		[176]={
			{
"We mustn't forget he who saved me and disappeared alongside Kahaku.",
			},
		},
		[177]={
			{
"─Mitsurugi.",
			},
		},
		[178]={
			{
"Though you are no more, your memory will always live on within me.",
			},
		},
		[179]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“What's the matter?”",
			},
		},
		[180]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Nah, it's nothing.”",
			},
		},
		[181]={
			{
"Tonight, I raise my cup for the first time in forever─",
			},
		},
		[182]={
			{
"To you, who fought tirelessly for two thousand years. May you rest easy.",
			},
		},
		[183]={
			{
"Just as we expected, there were more than a few who were opposed to the Empress's marriage to a common warrior.",
			},
		},
		[184]={
			{
"However, rather than forcibly imposing her will as Empress, Akari managed to gradually win their understanding through dialogue.",
			},
		},
		[185]={
			{
"As a result, many of her former political opponents came to share in her new vision of the Empire.",
			},
		},
		[186]={
			{
"Thus we find ourselves here today─the first traces of summer drifting across the breeze─at the commencement of Empress Touka's wedding ceremony.",
			},
		},
		[187]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Soujin, shall we?”",
			},
		},
		[188]={
			{
"The horse at the head of our carriage lets off a whinny as we set off.",
			},
		},
		[189]={
			{
"Immediately, we're met by raucous applause from all directions.",
			},
		},
		[190]={
			{
"Not only are the sidewalks thronged with spectators, every building we pass has onlookers leaning out of every window.",
			},
		},
		[191]={
			{
"Everyone's expressions are bright and hopeful.",
			},
		},
		[192]={
			{
"Each and every person's face shines with optimism for the new era.",
			},
		},
		[193]={
			{
"Our carriage proceeds slowly through the veritable shower of confetti.",
			},
		},
		[194]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Well? How's it feel knowing you're married to the Empress?”",
			},
		},
		[195]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Honestly, it still doesn't feel real.”",
			},
		},
		[196]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“But I suppose as the Empress's groom, I'll need to start acting as a proper role model for the people.”",
			},
		},
		[197]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You, a proper role model?”",
			},
		},
		[198]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I hate to badmouth my man, but isn't that asking too much?”",
			},
		},
		[199]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I knew it.”",
			},
		},
		[200]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Yeah, just give it up.”",
			},
		},
		[201]={
			{
"Akari grins with amusement.",
			},
		},
		[202]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Who told you that, anyway?”",
			},
		},
		[203]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Oh, lemme guess. It was Inou, wasn't it?”",
			},
		},
		[204]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Sure was.”",
			},
		},
		[205]={
			{
"She was fussing over every last thing, like a fawning mother about to send her child out into the world.",
			},
		},
		[206]={
			{
"Recalling her distraught expression, the corners of my mouth quirk upwards.",
			},
		},
		[207]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I don't know whose fault it is, but I'm just not built for any of this complicated stuff.”",
			},
		},
		[208]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“The only thing I can do is protect you.”",
			},
		},
		[209]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Having someone by my side who can say that and really mean it, I must be the luckiest girl in the world.”",
			},
		},
		[210]={
			{
"Akari sidles up next to me.",
			},
		},
		[211]={
			{
"We just so happen to be passing the same spot where Akari attacked Okonogi last year.",
			},
		},
		[212]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Remember this place?”",
			},
		},
		[213]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Of course. You were standing right on top of that traffic light right there.”",
			},
		},
		[214]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I never thought I'd live to see a day like this.”",
			},
		},
		[215]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“The only thing on my mind back then was avenging my mother, but someone managed to lead me all this way...”",
			},
		},
		[216]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Soujin, that someone was you.”",
			},
		},
		[217]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“It still gives me chills just imagining what would've happened if we never met.”",
			},
		},
		[218]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I should be the one who's grateful.”",
			},
		},
		[219]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If I'd never met you, I'd still be nothing but a tool.”",
			},
		},
		[220]={
			{
"Our meeting was surely no coincidence.",
			},
		},
		[221]={
			{
"The fates must have seen fit to reunite us after two thousand long years.",
			},
		},
		[222]={
			{
"And that destined meeting of ours set everything in motion.",
			},
		},
		[223]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“We should be thankful to the Founding Empress and Mitsurugi for guiding our path.”",
			},
		},
		[224]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“And our predecessors for protecting the Empire.”",
			},
		},
		[225]={
			{
"Empress Suou, Okonogi, Kokuan-dono─",
			},
		},
		[226]={
			{
"They all gave the full measure of their devotion to protect the Empire, entrusting the future to us.",
			},
		},
		[227]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Let's show them that they left the Empire in good hands.”",
			},
		},
		[228]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Knowing you, you'll blow away their expectations.”",
			},
		},
		[229]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Knowing us, you mean.”",
			},
		},
		[230]={
			{
"Akari turns to wave to the people, her smile as radiant as the midsummer sun.",
			},
		},
		[231]={
			{
"The outpouring of cheers and the downpour of confetti all serve to congratulate us on our union.",
			},
		},
		[232]={
			{
"From today on, I will be the emperor-consort of Empress Touka.",
			},
		},
		[233]={
			{
"I am to live in the Imperial Palace as a member of the Imperial Family, and to leave my name on the Empire's history.",
			},
		},
		[234]={
			{
"This is an unprecedented honor for one born a warrior.",
			},
		},
		[235]={
			{
"The sort of happily ever after that might be found in a fairy tale.",
			},
		},
		[236]={
			{
"But no matter how sumptuous my clothing, my nature shall never change.",
			},
		},
		[237]={
			{
"Tokita Soujin will always be a warrior.",
			},
		},
		[238]={
			{
"The loyal servant of Miyaguni Akari.",
			},
		},
		[239]={
			{
"As such, for as long as I live, I will only ever have but one purpose─",
			},
		},
		[240]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Even should my life be extinguished, I shall forge a blade from my very soul to smite my enemies.”",
			},
		},
		[241]={
			hide=1,
			{
"I shall continue my fight, in order to keep the vow we made that day in the snow.",
			},
		},
		[242]={
			hide=1,
			{
"To protect you, my love, and the new life within you.",
			},
		},
	},
	label={
	},
}
